aph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns an iterator for the map's keys in sorted order"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-10","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IterableIterator"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TKey"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An iterator for the map's keys"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"restoreorder","children":[{"type":"text","value":"restoreOrder()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"restoreOrder(): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L88","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:88"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Restore the ordered view after a synchronous batch of deferred writes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-11","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"set","children":[{"type":"text","value":"set()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"set(\n   key, \n   value, \n   deferOrder): this;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L108","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:108"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Sets a key-value pair in the map and maintains sort order"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-6","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"key-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"key"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The key to set"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"value","children":[{"type":"text","value":"value"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The value to associate with the key"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"deferorder-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"deferOrder"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defer ordering until restoreOrder or the next ordered read"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-12","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"this"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This SortedMap instance for chaining"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"values","children":[{"type":"text","value":"values()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"values(): IterableIterator<TValue>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L241","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:241"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns an iterator for the map's values in sorted order"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-13","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IterableIterator"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An iterator for the map's values"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tkey","text":"TKey","level":3},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"constructors","text":"Constructors","level":2},{"id":"constructor","text":"Constructor","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"comparator","text":"comparator?","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"accessors","text":"Accessors","level":2},{"id":"size","text":"size","level":3},{"id":"get-signature","text":"Get Signature","level":4},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"methods","text":"Methods","level":2},{"id":"iterator","text":"[iterator]()","level":3},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"clear","text":"clear()","level":3},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"delete","text":"delete()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"key","text":"key","level":5},{"id":"deferorder","text":"deferOrder","level":5},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"entries","text":"entries()","level":3},{"id":"returns-6","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"foreach","text":"forEach()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-3","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"callbackfn","text":"callbackfn","level":5},{"id":"returns-7","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"get","text":"get()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-4","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"key-2","text":"key","level":5},{"id":"returns-8","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"has","text":"has()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-5","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"key-3","text":"key","level":5},{"id":"returns-9","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"keys","text":"keys()","level":3},{"id":"returns-10","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"restoreorder","text":"restoreOrder()","level":3},{"id":"returns-11","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"set","text":"set()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-6","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"key-4","text":"key","level":5},{"id":"value","text":"value","level":5},{"id":"deferorder-2","text":"deferOrder","level":5},{"id":"returns-12","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"values","text":"values()","level":3},{"id":"returns-13","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:8](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L8)\n\nA Map implementation that keeps its entries sorted based on a comparator function\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TKey\n\n`TKey` *extends* `string` \\| `number`\n\nThe type of keys in the map (must be string | number)\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\nThe type of values in the map\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew SortedMap<TKey, TValue>(comparator?): SortedMap<TKey, TValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:21](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L21)\n\nCreates a new SortedMap instance\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### comparator?\n\n(`a`, `b`) => `number`\n\nOptional function to compare values for sorting.\n                    If not provided, entries are sorted by key only.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`SortedMap`\\<`TKey`, `TValue`\\>\n\n## Accessors\n\n### size\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget size(): number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:201](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L201)\n\nGets the number of key-value pairs in the map\n\n##### Returns\n\n`number`\n\n## Methods\n\n### \\[iterator\\]()\n\n```ts\niterator: IterableIterator<[TKey, TValue]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:210](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L210)\n\nDefault iterator that returns entries in sorted order\n\n#### Returns\n\n`IterableIterator`\\<\\[`TKey`, `TValue`\\]\\>\n\nAn iterator for the map's entries\n\n***\n\n### clear()\n\n```ts\nclear(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:191](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L191)\n\nRemoves all key-value pairs from the map\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### delete()\n\n```ts\ndelete(key, deferOrder): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:158](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L158)\n\nRemoves a key-value pair from the map\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### key\n\n`TKey`\n\nThe key to remove\n\n##### deferOrder\n\n`boolean` = `false`\n\nDefer ordering until restoreOrder or the next ordered read\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if the key was found and removed, false otherwise\n\n***\n\n### entries()\n\n```ts\nentries(): IterableIterator<[TKey, TValue]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:222](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L222)\n\nReturns an iterator for the map's entries in sorted order\n\n#### Returns\n\n`IterableIterator`\\<\\[`TKey`, `TValue`\\]\\>\n\nAn iterator for the map's entries\n\n***\n\n### forEach()\n\n```ts\nforEach(callbackfn): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:253](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L253)\n\nExecutes a callback function for each key-value pair in the map in sorted order\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### callbackfn\n\n(`value`, `key`, `map`) => `void`\n\nFunction to execute for each entry\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### get()\n\n```ts\nget(key): TValue | undefined;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:147](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L147)\n\nGets a value by its key\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### key\n\n`TKey`\n\nThe key to look up\n\n#### Returns\n\n`TValue` \\| `undefined`\n\nThe value associated with the key, or undefined if not found\n\n***\n\n### has()\n\n```ts\nhas(key): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:184](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L184)\n\nChecks if a key exists in the map\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### key\n\n`TKey`\n\nThe key to check\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if the key exists, false otherwise\n\n***\n\n### keys()\n\n```ts\nkeys(): IterableIterator<TKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:231](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L231)\n\nReturns an iterator for the map's keys in sorted order\n\n#### Returns\n\n`IterableIterator`\\<`TKey`\\>\n\nAn iterator for the map's keys\n\n***\n\n### restoreOrder()\n\n```ts\nrestoreOrder(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:88](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L88)\n\nRestore the ordered view after a synchronous batch of deferred writes.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### set()\n\n```ts\nset(\n   key, \n   value, \n   deferOrder): this;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:108](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L108)\n\nSets a key-value pair in the map and maintains sort order\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### key\n\n`TKey`\n\nThe key to set\n\n##### value\n\n`TValue`\n\nThe value to associate with the key\n\n##### deferOrder\n\n`boolean` = `false`\n\nDefer ordering until restoreOrder or the next ordered read\n\n#### Returns\n\n`this`\n\nThis SortedMap instance for chaining\n\n***\n\n### values()\n\n```ts\nvalues(): IterableIterator<TValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:241](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L241)\n\nReturns an iterator for the map's values in sorted order\n\n#### Returns\n\n`IterableIterator`\\<`TValue`\\>\n\nAn iterator for the map's values\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SortedMap\ntitle: SortedMap\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:8](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L8)\n\nA Map implementation that keeps its entries sorted based on a comparator function\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TKey\n\n`TKey` *extends* `string` \\| `number`\n\nThe type of keys in the map (must be string | number)\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\nThe type of values in the map\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew SortedMap<TKey, TValue>(comparator?): SortedMap<TKey, TValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:21](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L21)\n\nCreates a new SortedMap instance\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### comparator?\n\n(`a`, `b`) => `number`\n\nOptional function to compare values for sorting.\n                    If not provided, entries are sorted by key only.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`SortedMap`\\<`TKey`, `TValue`\\>\n\n## Accessors\n\n### size\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget size(): number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:201](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L201)\n\nGets the number of key-value pairs in the map\n\n##### Returns\n\n`number`\n\n## Methods\n\n### \\[iterator\\]()\n\n```ts\niterator: IterableIterator<[TKey, TValue]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:210](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L210)\n\nDefault iterator that returns entries in sorted order\n\n#### Returns\n\n`IterableIterator`\\<\\[`TKey`, `TValue`\\]\\>\n\nAn iterator for the map's entries\n\n***\n\n### clear()\n\n```ts\nclear(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:191](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L191)\n\nRemoves all key-value pairs from the map\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### delete()\n\n```ts\ndelete(key, deferOrder): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:158](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L158)\n\nRemoves a key-value pair from the map\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### key\n\n`TKey`\n\nThe key to remove\n\n##### deferOrder\n\n`boolean` = `false`\n\nDefer ordering until restoreOrder or the next ordered read\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if the key was found and removed, false otherwise\n\n***\n\n### entries()\n\n```ts\nentries(): IterableIterator<[TKey, TValue]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:222](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L222)\n\nReturns an iterator for the map's entries in sorted order\n\n#### Returns\n\n`IterableIterator`\\<\\[`TKey`, `TValue`\\]\\>\n\nAn iterator for the map's entries\n\n***\n\n### forEach()\n\n```ts\nforEach(callbackfn): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:253](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L253)\n\nExecutes a callback function for each key-value pair in the map in sorted order\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### callbackfn\n\n(`value`, `key`, `map`) => `void`\n\nFunction to execute for each entry\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### get()\n\n```ts\nget(key): TValue | undefined;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:147](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L147)\n\nGets a value by its key\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### key\n\n`TKey`\n\nThe key to look up\n\n#### Returns\n\n`TValue` \\| `undefined`\n\nThe value associated with the key, or undefined if not found\n\n***\n\n### has()\n\n```ts\nhas(key): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:184](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L184)\n\nChecks if a key exists in the map\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### key\n\n`TKey`\n\nThe key to check\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if the key exists, false otherwise\n\n***\n\n### keys()\n\n```ts\nkeys(): IterableIterator<TKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:231](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L231)\n\nReturns an iterator for the map's keys in sorted order\n\n#### Returns\n\n`IterableIterator`\\<`TKey`\\>\n\nAn iterator for the map's keys\n\n***\n\n### restoreOrder()\n\n```ts\nrestoreOrder(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:88](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L88)\n\nRestore the ordered view after a synchronous batch of deferred writes.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### set()\n\n```ts\nset(\n   key, \n   value, \n   deferOrder): this;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:108](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L108)\n\nSets a key-value pair in the map and maintains sort order\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### key\n\n`TKey`\n\nThe key to set\n\n##### value\n\n`TValue`\n\nThe value to associate with the key\n\n##### deferOrder\n\n`boolean` = `false`\n\nDefer ordering until restoreOrder or the next ordered read\n\n#### Returns\n\n`this`\n\nThis SortedMap instance for chaining\n\n***\n\n### values()\n\n```ts\nvalues(): IterableIterator<TValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts:241](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/SortedMap.ts#L241)\n\nReturns an iterator for the map's values in sorted order\n\n#### Returns\n\n`IterableIterator`\\<`TValue`\\>\n\nAn iterator for the map's values\n"}
